# Status Checking

## Purpose
Utility functions for status checking and validation in SND macros.

## Scope
This rule covers player status checking, plugin status validation, and system state monitoring.

## Basic Status Functions

### Player Status Checking
```lua
-- Check if player is available
function IsPlayerAvailable()
    return Player.Available
end

-- Check if player is busy
function IsPlayerBusy()
    return Player.IsBusy
end

-- Check if player is in combat
function IsPlayerInCombat()
    return Player.InCombat
end

-- Check if player is mounted
function IsPlayerMounted()
    return Player.IsMounted
end
```

### Plugin Status Checking
```lua
-- Check if plugin is available
function HasPlugin(pluginName)
    for plugin in luanet.each(Svc.PluginInterface.InstalledPlugins) do
        if plugin.InternalName == pluginName and plugin.IsLoaded then
            return true
        end
    end
    return false
end

-- Check if plugin is running
function IsPluginRunning(pluginName)
    if not HasPlugin(pluginName) then
        return false
    end
    
    -- Plugin-specific running checks
    if pluginName == "vnavmesh" then
        return IPC.vnavmesh.IsRunning()
    elseif pluginName == "Artisan" then
        return IPC.Artisan.IsListRunning()
    elseif pluginName == "Lifestream" then
        return IPC.Lifestream.IsBusy()
    elseif pluginName == "Saucy" then
        return IPC.Saucy.IsRunning()
    end
    
    return false
end
```

## Advanced Status Functions

### Character Condition Checking
```lua
-- Check character conditions
function IsCharacterInCondition(conditionId)
    return Svc.Condition[conditionId] or false
end

-- Check if character is busy with any condition
function IsCharacterBusy()
    return Svc.Condition[CharacterCondition.casting] or
           Svc.Condition[CharacterCondition.betweenAreas] or
           Svc.Condition[CharacterCondition.beingMoved] or
           Svc.Condition[CharacterCondition.occupiedInQuestEvent] or
           Svc.Condition[CharacterCondition.occupiedMateriaExtractionAndRepair] or
           Svc.Condition[CharacterCondition.occupiedSummoningBell] or
           Player.IsBusy
end
```

### System Status Checking
```lua
-- Check if game is in focus
function IsGameInFocus()
    return Svc.ClientState.IsLoggedIn
end

-- Check if character is logged in
function IsCharacterLoggedIn()
    return Svc.ClientState.IsLoggedIn and Player.Available
end

-- Check if in cutscene
function IsInCutscene()
    return Svc.Condition[CharacterCondition.inCutscene] or false
end
```

## Plugin-Specific Status Functions

### vnavmesh Status
```lua
-- Check vnavmesh status
function GetVnavmeshStatus()
    if not HasPlugin("vnavmesh") then
        return "not_available"
    end
    
    if IPC.vnavmesh.IsRunning() then
        return "running"
    elseif IPC.vnavmesh.PathfindInProgress() then
        return "pathfinding"
    else
        return "idle"
    end
end
```

### Artisan Status
```lua
-- Check Artisan status
function GetArtisanStatus()
    if not HasPlugin("Artisan") then
        return "not_available"
    end
    
    if IPC.Artisan.IsListRunning() then
        if IPC.Artisan.IsListPaused() then
            return "paused"
        else
            return "running"
        end
    else
        return "idle"
    end
end
```

